{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "白色圣诞节结束的隔天，天空晴朗无云。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我们却关在房间里亲亲。", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……骗子，你不是说要忍耐接吻吗？”", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4558", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪不是也说了？”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我是说了，可是我好像办不到所以新吾要忍耐啊。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4559", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啊，抱歉。看到你的脸我又想亲了。”", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4560", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，亲我吧。”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你真的有想让我忍耐？”", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因为比起自己主动，你亲我的时候感觉更心动嘛。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被她这样说，我无论如何都想让她心动了。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我抬起她的下巴，轻轻吻上。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我感觉得出纱凪的紧张。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后过了一会又放松下来，这让我喜欢得受不了。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“心动了吗？”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，心动了。”", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪把脸埋在我的胸口。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我亲新吾的时候，你也会心动吗？”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我现在就心动了。”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就让你多心动一点！”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这次纱凪抱着我的头主动吻我。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾真的是好可爱喔……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像明白了被纱凪照顾的动物们是什么感觉。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她原本就是对动物们有着强烈保护欲的女孩。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而现在她把那些情绪都放到我身上。", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊，这么幸福真的可以吗……”", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“幸福到让人害怕呢。”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾陶醉的眼睛，好可爱……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是还要让你更陶醉一点♪”", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪的吻跟第一次时一样，有点生涩。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且她主动吻我时一定会睁开眼睛吻。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好乖好乖，新吾好可爱捏～”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用充满母性的眼神注视我。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想对我撒娇娇吗？”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的脑袋与其说融化，更像是被破坏的感觉。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就这样变成小宝宝对她撒娇。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪，禁止你用小宝宝语。”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸～为什么？”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太可爱了，我好像要疯掉。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的～让人拿你没办法的男孩子呢～”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经快沦陷了。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就像着小孩子一样抱紧纱凪的身体。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我也差不多该学会料理才行。”", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，突然说这个？”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“像这样抱着新吾，就让我有这个想法。”", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这就是所谓的母性本能吗？”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身为男人的我不懂。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我知道现在的自己被纱凪深爱着。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以进去吗？”", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0411", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以是可以，但是等一下。”", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟在理央君面前不好意思这样，纱凪放开了我。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以进来了喔。”", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她说完后，房间门被推开。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼嗯。”", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0412", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、什么……怎么了，那盘料理……？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我试着做的。”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0413", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "理央君把一个盛着料理的大盘子放在桌上。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "香肠、煎荷包，还有卷心菜丝。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然都是简单的东西，但也是一道料理。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是理央做的？”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“做得普通。”", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0414", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么普通，做得比我还好了。”", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我每次煎荷包蛋，最后都会变成碎成一盘的炒蛋……”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像能想像那个情景。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你是自己练习的吗？”", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱奈教我的。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0415", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃？”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到老师的名字，纱凪的表情也很惊讶。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么一说，理央君的确常常来我们家玩。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，她教我料理。”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0416", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什、什么时候……完全没注意到……”", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“以后，早上由我来做料理。”", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0417", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“渣虫就快点去学校。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0418", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道这是理央君的体贴。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为纱凪为了社团早上都很早起。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以他才特地跑来我们家请樱乃教他料理吧。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……虽然很高兴，但你别勉强喔。还想睡就多睡一点没关系。”", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道。”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0419", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“话说回来，你们亲亲了吗？”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0420", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪听到这个耳熟的问题，瞥了我一眼。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼哼～秘密♪”", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……反正有没有都无所谓。”", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0421", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到纱凪那个别有深意的回答，理央君没什么兴趣似的把头转开了。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，吃这个。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0422", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“等一下，你不是为了姐姐做的吗？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "理央", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“吃土吧你。”", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "理央", "alt_speaker_idx": 282, "voice": "_ri0423", "char_id": "理央"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "留下无情的一句话，理央君离开了房间。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，我们一起吃吧？”", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 279, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我会很快学会料理的。我可不能输给那样的小孩子！”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 288, "voice": "_sn4590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很快”，但我就不去想实际会花多少时间了。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
